{"step_index":898,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-20T21:06:30Z","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":"{\"RequestFeedback\":false,\"Summary\":\"Added full database export & seamless multi-source import/recovery system supporting iCloud Drive, Google Drive, OneDrive, email attachments, local files, clipboard JSON text, with Merge vs Overwrite restore options. Deployed live to Surge.\",\"UserFacing\":true}","CodeContent":"\"# Walkthrough: Database Export & Multi-Source Cloud Recovery System\\n\\nSnapDialer has been equipped with a complete backup and restore suite:\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 1. Features Implemented:\\n- **Multi-Destination Backup Export:**\\n  - **Download File (.json):** Generates a complete database snapshot file (`SnapDialer_ValuTeachers_Backup_YYYY-MM-DD.json`).\\n  - **Native OS Share Sheet:** Share directly to **Mail (email attachment), iCloud Drive, Google Drive, OneDrive, AirDrop, Messages, Dropbox**, or Files app.\\n  - **Copy JSON to Clipboard:** 1-tap full snapshot copy to clipboard to paste into emails, OneDrive docs, or Google Keep.\\n- **Multi-Source Import & Recovery:**\\n  - **File Browser Picker:** 1-tap **\\\"Import from File / Drive (.json)\\\"** opens the device file browser (allowing selection of files from **iCloud Drive, Google Drive, OneDrive, Downloads, or saved Email attachments**).\\n  - **Paste JSON Modal:** Allows pasting raw backup JSON text directly if received via email or text.\\n- **Flexible Restore Options:**\\n  - **Merge with Existing:** Adds new contacts from backup without wiping existing pipeline data.\\n  - **Clean Overwrite:** Completely restores the database to match the backup snapshot.\\n- **Full ValuTeachers Data Fidelity:**\\n  - Restores all teacher data, report card notes, FRS service years, meeting preferences, call logs, SMS templates, cadence rules, and Gemini API keys.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 2. Live Surge Deployment:\\n- URL: **`https://valuteachers-dialer.surge.sh`**\\n\"","Description":"\"Walkthrough documenting backup import/export features and Surge deployment\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\brorm\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\brain\\\\9c9b5ef4-82a1-483f-9e9e-cb421c9396b3\\\\walkthrough.md\"","toolAction":"\"Updating walkthrough for backup import/export features\"","toolSummary":"\"Update walkthrough.md with backup features\""}}]}
